*> RUN FROM JCL JOB SHPNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0004.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> PACKAGE WEIGHT IN KG
    05 SHIP-WEIGHT        PIC 9(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> SHIPPING CHARGE
    05 FREIGHT-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 2000-WEIGHT-BAND
    DISPLAY "FREIGHT-AMT=" FREIGHT-AMT
    STOP RUN.
2000-WEIGHT-BAND.
    *> LIGHT PARCEL
    IF SHIP-WEIGHT <= 5
        MOVE 7 TO FREIGHT-AMT
    ELSE
        *> MEDIUM PARCEL
        IF SHIP-WEIGHT <= 10
            MOVE 15 TO FREIGHT-AMT
        ELSE
            COMPUTE FREIGHT-AMT = SHIP-WEIGHT * 1.25
        END-IF
    END-IF.
